      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INDEPENDENT_DRAGON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "과연, 성장했구나.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "なるほど、成長したのう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
